title":"少年行","author":"谢榛","text":"年少绿衣郎，春游凤城下。\n醉弄珊瑚鞭，嗔人不避马。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":15115,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉阶怨","author":"谢榛","text":"夜色冷深宫，丽人眠复起。\n风生绿桂枝，月落银塘水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":15116,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长相思","author":"谢榛","text":"郁郁相思树，上有相思鸟。\n相思人不来，风雨愁多少。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":15117,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题席浒北书亭","author":"谢榛","text":"白白野云暮，青青阶草春。\n小亭閒日月，谁问著书人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":15118,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意 其一","author":"谢榛","text":"百转辘轳金井深，美人汲水梧桐阴。\n流云在天日将暮，独有寒泉知素心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":15119,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意 其二","author":"谢榛","text":"郎种菊花何远离，秋来花发倍相思。\n玉京郎醉菊花酒，不见故园霜露枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":15120,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"侠客行","author":"谢榛","text":"晓来独酌酒家楼，掷下黄金不掉头。\n走马西山射豺虎，风霜吹满锦貂裘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":15121,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"公子行","author":"谢榛","text":"京洛王孙日有期，千金买马恨行迟。\n隔花忽见游春女，笑举丝鞭问阿谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":15122,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"老将行","author":"谢榛","text":"虬髯丈夫乘铁骢，自言征战老云中。\n凭陵仗剑出门去，原上枯桑鸣朔风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":15123,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞上曲 其一","author":"谢榛","text":"秋生关塞晓霜飞，日上辕门探骑归。\n百战将军惊白发，不知凋敝几征衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":15124,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金笳曲 其二","author":"谢榛","text":"碧眼名王貂鼠衣，天寒走马猎金微。\n弯弓仰射双雕下，日晚穹庐带雪归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":15125,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古怨","author":"谢榛","text":"阿郎裘马欲从军，空说边庭有战云。\n夜夜青楼买歌舞，愁人风雨不曾闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":15126,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九月雪","author":"谢榛","text":"雁拂同云过戍楼，菊花含冻不成秋。\n迷茫夜拥金微路，未寄寒衣人正愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":15127,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"少年行","author":"谢榛","text":"灯下呼卢几夜残，今秋召募到长安。\n相期白刃清狐塞，要使黄金饰马鞍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":15128,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄吴峻伯","author":"谢榛","text":"仙帆曾约蓟门游，醉听吴歌下碧流。\n千里云山成寂寞，北风吹雁到湖州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":15129,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮秋有感寄栾侍御孔原","author":"谢榛","text":"别后封章天上闻，几经秋草未逢君。\n于今漫忆栾巴酒，汉殿迷茫愁暮云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":15130,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送钟季烈奔丧豫章","author":"谢榛","text":"郎官才转汉西曹，白舫归心日夜劳。\n啼杀樯乌孤月惨，九江寒色起风涛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":15131,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酬刘中丞道甫见寄","author":"谢榛","text":"开府孤吟黄鸟边，蓟门相别几华年。\n西南古道分三楚，江汉春云共一天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":15132,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄武当山张隐君 其二","author":"谢榛","text":"云岩深处独逍遥，海鹤传书昨见招。\n月下定逢王子晋，玉笙吹下摘星桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":15133,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦张肖甫","author":"谢榛","text":"素琴遥忆美人弹，梦到铜梁落月寒。\n江口蘋花忽相见，不知行路蜀中难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":15134,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"屈平","author":"谢榛","text":"初著离骚去国年，独醒怀抱转悽然。\n汨罗不作西流水，终古愁云在楚天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":15135,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]